      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu walianza kumlalamikia Mwenyezi-Mungu juu ya taabu zao. Mwenyezi-Mungu aliposikia, alishikwa na hasira, akawapelekea moto. Moto huo uliwaka kati yao na kuchoma upande mmoja wa kambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wakamlilia Mose, naye akamwomba Mwenyezi-Mungu na moto huo ukazimika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo, mahali hapo pakaitwa Tabera,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tabera:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Jina hili ni kama neno la Kiebrania lenye maana “kuchoma”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kwa sababu hapo moto wa Mwenyezi-Mungu uliwaka kati ya watu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miongoni mwa Waisraeli kulikuwa na kundi fulani lililoandamana nao ambalo lilikuwa na hamu kubwa. Waisraeli kwa mara nyingine walilia, wakisema. “Laiti kama tungeweza kupata nyama ya kula! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tunakumbuka, samaki tuliokula kule Misri bila malipo, matango, matikiti, mboga, vitunguu na vitunguu saumu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini sasa nguvu zimetuishia na hakuna chakula kingine isipokuwa hii mana tu!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana ilikuwa kama punje za mtama, rangi yake ilikuwa kama ya bedoza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu walizungukazunguka na kuikusanya, kisha waliisaga kwa mawe ya kusagia au waliitwanga kwa vinu, halafu waliitokosa vyunguni na kutengeneza maandazi. Ladha yake ilikuwa kama ya maandazi yaliyokaangwa kwa mafuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Kut 16:13-15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " (Umande ulipoanguka kambini wakati wa usiku, mana pia ilianguka pamoja na huo umande).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose alisikia watu wakilia katika familia zote, kila mtu penye lango la hema lake. Basi, hasira ya Mwenyezi-Mungu iliwaka sana; naye Mose alichukizwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Mose alipomwambia, Mwenyezi-Mungu “Kwa nini unanitendea vibaya mimi mtumishi wako? Mbona hupendezwi nami, kwa nini umenitwika mzigo wa kuwatunza watu wote hawa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Je, ni mimi niliyewazaa, hata ukaniambia niwabebe kifuani pangu kama mlezi abebavyo mtoto mchanga, na kuwapeleka mpaka nchi uliyoapa kuwapa babu zao? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitapata wapi nyama ya kuwalisha watu hawa wote? Maana wanalia mbele yangu wakisema: ‘Tupe nyama tule!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siwezi kuwatunza watu wote hawa peke yangu; hilo ni jukumu kubwa mno kwangu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikiwa hivi ndivyo utakavyonitenda, afadhali uniue mara moja! Kama ninapata kibali mbele yako, usiniache niikabili taabu yangu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Mose, “Wakusanyeni wazee sabini wa Israeli, ambao wewe unajua wanaheshimiwa na kukubaliwa na watu kuwa viongozi, uwalete kwenye hema la mkutano, wasimame karibu nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitashuka huko na kuzungumza nawe; nitachukua sehemu ya roho niliyokupa, niwape watu hao. Nao watabeba jukumu la kuwatunza watu hawa pamoja nawe, usije ukaubeba mzigo huo peke yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasa waambie watu hivi: Jitakaseni kwa ajili ya kesho; mtakula nyama. Mwenyezi-Mungu amesikia mkilia na kusema kuwa hakuna wa kuwapeni nyama, na kwamba hali yenu ilikuwa nzuri zaidi mlipokuwa Misri. Sasa Mwenyezi-Mungu atawapeni nyama, nanyi sharti muile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtakula nyama si kwa muda wa siku moja tu, au mbili, au tano, au kumi au ishirini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bali kwa muda wa mwezi mzima! Mtaila hadi iwatoke puani, mpaka muikinai. Yote hayo ni kwa sababu mmemkataa Mwenyezi-Mungu aliye hapahapa miongoni mwenu, na kulia mbele yake mkisema, ‘Kwa nini tulitoka Misri?’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Mose alimwambia Mwenyezi-Mungu, “Idadi ya watu ninaowaongoza hapa ni 600,000 waendao kwa miguu, nawe wasema, ‘Nitawapa nyama ya kuwatosha mwezi mzima!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Je, panaweza kuchinjwa kondoo na ng'ombe wa kuwatosheleza? Je, samaki wote baharini wavuliwe kwa ajili yao?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu akamjibu Mose, “Je, uwezo wangu umepungua? Utaona basi kama neno langu litakuwa la kweli kwako au la.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Mose akaenda na kuwajulisha watu yale aliyosema Mwenyezi-Mungu. Kisha, akakusanya wazee sabini kutoka miongoni mwa wazee viongozi nao akawaweka kandokando kuizunguka hema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hapo, Mwenyezi-Mungu akashuka katika wingu na kuzungumza naye. Halafu akatwaa sehemu ya roho aliyokuwa amempa Mose, akawapa kila mmoja wa wale wazee sabini. Walipoingiwa na roho hiyo, wazee hao walianza kutoa unabii, lakini hawakurudia kufanya hivyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wazee wawili kati ya wale sabini waliochaguliwa, Eldadi na Medadi, walikuwa wamebaki kambini wenzao walipokwenda kwenye hema. Roho iliwajia humohumo kambini, wakaanza kutoa unabii mahali walipokuwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kijana mmoja alitoka mbio na kumwambia Mose, “Eldadi na Medadi wanatoa unabii kambini.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hapo, Yoshua, mwana wa Nuni, ambaye alikuwa msaidizi wa Mose tangu ujana wake, akamwambia Mose, “Bwana wangu, wakataze!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Mose akamjibu, “Je, unaona wivu kwa ajili yangu? Laiti Mwenyezi-Mungu angewapa watu wake wote roho yake nao wakawa manabii!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Mose alirudi kambini pamoja na wale wazee sabini wa Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baadaye Mwenyezi-Mungu akavumisha upepo kwa ghafla, ukaleta kware kutoka baharini na kuwafanya watue kando ya kambi, mwendo wa siku moja hivi kila upande kuizunguka kambi, wakarundikana chini karibu kimo cha mita moja hivi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, siku hiyo yote, kutwa kucha, na siku iliyofuata watu walishughulika kukusanya kware; hakuna mtu aliyekusanya chini ya kilo 1,000. Wakawaanika kila mahali kandokando ya kambi ili wawakaushe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulipokuwa bado kuna nyama kwa wingi na kabla watu hawajawamaliza kuila, Mwenyezi-Mungu aliwakasirikia watu, akawapiga watu kwa pigo kubwa sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo mahali hapo palipewa jina Kibroth-hataava;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:34",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kibroth-hataava:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Maana yake “makaburi ya tamaa”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kwa sababu huko ndiko walikowazika watu waliokuwa walafi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
